          "title": "You'll want to know: la façade",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "la façade — \"the façade, the front (of a building)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "La façade de la mairie est toute blanche. The front of the town hall is all white."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Figurative: c'est de la façade — it is all for show."
            }
          ]
        },
